/playinganalytics/git/gobbi/.gobbi/projects/gobbi/worktrees/chore/session-2026-05-28-8eed14fb/.gobbi/projects/gobbi/skills/memorization/SKILL.md:264:| `sessions/{date}-{session-id}/{loop}/staging/scenarios/{slug}.md` | assistant (MEMORIZATION) | PASS only — per `scenario_gap` finding |
