/playinganalytics/git/gobbi/.gobbi/projects/gobbi/worktrees/chore/session-2026-05-28-8eed14fb/.gobbi/projects/gobbi/skills/delegation/SKILL.md:77:- `executor` adds **Self-Review checklist** + **Verification Commands**.
